  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Full release notes: https://github.com/rafalka/MauiSkiaUi/blob/v1.0.0-Prerelease11/CHANGELOG.md#100-prerelease11\n\nNew features\n- Picker (C6)\n- Pickers with several choices (C6b)\n- The picker's selected row is the app's to style\n- Multi-column picker (C6b)\n- Choices that wait for OK (C6b)\n- Picker options (C6c)\n- The field drawn through a template (C6c)\n- Tokens for several choices (C6c)\n- The app's views and \"Select all\" in picker popups (C6c)\n- Wheels' parts and the popup's look (C6c)\n- Items that cannot be chosen (C6c)\n- Clearing a picker (C6c)\n- Date and time pickers (C7)\n- SkiaUi's own texts in one place\n- Popups on the app's popup system (C6)\n- Platform looks\n- New package, SkiaUi.Maui.CommunityToolkit\n- Carousel (C4)\n- Indicator view (C4)",
